window.products.push({"id":1031142,"name":"Esright Gray Power Lift Chair Electric Recliner Sofa for Elderly, Microfiber Electric Recliner Chair with Heated Vibration Massage, Side Pocket and US","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-lEceg8yL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"【ABOUT Esright】 - Esright has stayed true to our principles as we continue to bring quality and comfort to people around the world. We insist on choosing environmentally friendly timber with higher production costs. All wood boards are formaldehyde-free, conform to the P2 Requirement of California Air Resources Board. Durable steel construction ensures long time use. We committed to protect the health of the elderly who chooses our electric lift chair. 【UL Approved Silent Lift Motor】 - Design of right arm control panel, our lift recliner chair reclines up to 150 degrees,the footrest and backrest are extended or retracted Simultaneously. With our powerful silent lift motor, our lift chair can pushes the entire chair up to help the senior stand up easily without adding stress to back or knees. You can smoothly adjust to customized position and stop lifting or reclining at any position you needed. 【USB Port & Lift Control Panel & Heated Vibration Massage】 - Lift & Recline control panel on the right armrest and integrates USB charging function, easy to operate. (Note:The USB port ONLY for Low-Power devices, such as Phone, iPad or Headset).This chair also has heated vibration massage function. There are 4 areas of massage(shin, thigh, lumbar, head) and 5 modes( pulse, press, wave, auto, normal). Massage remote control will more convenience for elder to choose the massage function. 【Soft Fabric and Overstuffed Padding】: Lining Springs with Overstuffed backrest and padding cushion will bring you more comfortable, just like the whole body is wrapped up in chair. Entire chair covered by high-quality textile fabric, bring you more comfortable and relax feeling. Our chair can reclines up to 150 degrees, that will be a good angle to take rest or watch TV. 【Long Time Professional Service】: Come in 2 boxes and include assemble & use instructions. Super easy assemble and usually only need 10-15mins to finish the installation, no tools required. If any shipping damage when it arrive or defective during usage, please feel free to write us, we will provide best solution in 24 hours. We also provide 1 year technical support for the lift motor tand steel frame.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-lEceg8yL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Esright","source_asin":"B08DHSZXJ7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1031142","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08DHSZXJ7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08DHSZXJ7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
