window.products.push({"id":1031148,"name":"Twin Draft Guard Solo Guard, Weighted Under-Door Draft Noise Air Blocker and Window Draft Stopper, 4.3 Inches x 17.3 Inches, Brown","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lOF4mkfOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A small space between a door and a floor or a window and its frame can let in cold outside air and make you uncomfortable. It can also increase your heat and air conditioning costs, impacting your wallet and time. The Solo Guard is your solution! This window-and-door draft guard features an innovative design that prevents drafts from entering your home, blocking outside air from entering and sealing your cold or heated air inside. It also helps reduce noise and dirt! Each door air-draft stopper is compatible with all types of flooring, including carpet, tile, linoleum, and hardwood, so you can use it in any space.The Solo Guard won’t slip or slide out of place thanks to the 3 stone weights strategically placed at the ends and middle. You can use this heavy-duty draft stopper on doors or windows up to 36\" wide. Put it in the threshold or doorway of your entryway, garage, living room, bedroom, office, and more!The Solo Guard cold-air door draft stopper is easy to not only use but also clean. Simply remove the durable supersoft fleece cover and wash it in the washing machine. When you’re not using the Solo Guard, use the attached hook to hang it up in your cleaning-supply closet, laundry room, garage, or anywhere you store home accessories. Whether you’re trying to keep cold air from increasing your heating bills or trying to keep dust from drifting under your door during the summer, the Solo Guard will help keep your space clean and comfortable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lOF4mkfOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Twin Draft Guard","source_asin":"B082LZTKRT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1031148","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082LZTKRT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082LZTKRT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
