window.products.push({"id":1031293,"name":"Centuyia Christmas Handmade Swedish Gnome, Scandinavian Tomte, Yule Santa Nisse, Plush Figurine, Plush Elf Toy, Home Decor Christmas Party Gifts (Red)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hDBZn4gIL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Size is about 16x31cm/6.30x12.20in, Each Gnome, also known as a Tomte or Nisse, is individually handmade with lots of love! The figurine's body and hat are made of soft felt, plush nose, fiber white beard, and tall hat for posing. A LUCKY GNOME --- Gnome or Tomte, according to Scandinavian folklore, he is elderly, with a long beard. The Tomte is reputed to safeguard the farms, family and children, particularly at night. Gnomes is best known for guarding Earthly treasures and is perfect for protecting your Christmas goodies and adding some whimsy to your holiday decor. PERFECT GIFT --- The adorable gnome is traditionalist and perfect for spreading Christmas spirit. He would be the festive addition to your shelf & table and home decoration. A perfect gift to the family & friends' home at Christmas, Thanksgiving Day, Halloween, Birthday time","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hDBZn4gIL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Centuryia","source_asin":"B0811DGWMQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1031293","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0811DGWMQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0811DGWMQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1031294,"name":"Eterish Comforters for Queen Bed, Quilted Down Alternative Comforter Queen All Season, Lightweight White Comforter Queen Duvet Insert with Corner Tabs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ppkh4ExyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"About Eterish At Eterish, we CHERISH every moment with family and pets. Being together, any wonderful time is ETERNITY. Eterish aspires to offer more excellent solutions for the way you live with family members. Eterish queen size comforter features soft brushed microfiber shell which has a crisp weave that prevents any fill from escaping, while wicking away moisture and increasing airflow throughout the comforter. Whole-piece microfiber fill makes use of baffle-box stitching to keep the fill evenly distributed while maximizing the loft of the comforters. Also, down alternative comforter is lightweight but ultra-warm, imitating the feel of natural down, thus is great alternative for those with down sensitives and suitable for year-round use. SOFT-TO-TOUCH The outer shell is made of cozy brushed microfiber fabric with a soft-to-touch feel. WHOLE-PIECE DOWN ALTERNATIVE FILL Bed comforter is crafted with whole-piece down alternative microfiber fill designed to mimic the feel of down while resisting clumping. BOX-STITCH CONSTRUCTION End to end sewn through box quilting keeps the fill evenly distributed while maintaining the loft of the comforter. BUILT-IN CORNER TABS 4 built-in corner tabs secure duvet insert always in place so there will be no shifting and you won't have to fuss over your covers every night. Nothing's better than sliding under a soft, warm comforter when you climb into bed. Eterish white comforter is lightweight but ultra-warm to keep you perfectly cozy in the winter and comfortable in the summer. If you want to feel like you're sleeping under a warm cloud, Eterish white down alternative comforter will make all your dreams come true!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ppkh4ExyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Eterish","source_asin":"B08P2KGCJ8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1031294","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08P2KGCJ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08P2KGCJ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
