window.products.push({"id":1031365,"name":"Vön Goth + Funk Coffin Bat Holder for Keys & Jewelry Pack of 1 - Spooky Gothic Home Decor for Kitchens & Bedrooms - Pure Cast Iron - Wall Adhesives & ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yrRSI3kPS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🧛‍♀️ GOTHIC KEY HOLDER - If you love goth decor for your home, we can assure you that this cute bat with hooks is an absolute must. If you need gothic decor for your home or gothic stuff for a spooky Halloween, this was made for you. With 8 individual hooks, it's ideal to organize your keys, rings, pendants and amulets all year round! ⚰️ SPOOKY GOTHIC HOME DECOR - Looking for that spooky gothic decor that you’d die for (pun intended)? Look no further! Our gothic coffin-style bat hanging hooks will evoke that gothic vibe anytime you put it on the wall. Try them out in the hallway as a gothic key holder or use it as spooky door hook for your gothic bedroom as a gothic jewelry holder. Walk around your house now, start visualizing how this wall decor will transmogrify your house! 🦍 MADE FROM PURE CAST IRON - Let's get this out of the way, right off the bat. We made this spooky bat hanging hook from nothing less than tough (and thick) pure cast iron. We promise you, you will feel the weight when you get your hands on it. Dimensions: 9.6 x 9.4 x 1.3 inches 🔩 INCLUDES WALL ADHESIVE & SCREWS - You can attach this vampire bat hook on wooden coffin to almost any surface you want to - this pack includes wall adhesive and screws for the keyhole slots, to help you fix them on anything from tiles, glass, wood and metals, right through to painted walls. Vön Goth + Funk's coffin bat jewelry and key holder is the fang-tastic witchy home decor item you didn't even know you needed. 🛍️ IDEAL QUIRKY GIFT - Know anyone who likes creepy decor, or is obsessed with Halloween themed parties? We can't think of anything more perfect for them and their home. Our Coffin Bat style key organizer is the perfect gift for those who love witchy decor and quirky gothic home artifacts. This coffin bat key holder is the ideal creepy decor for your friends and family to enjoy all year round, or even just to put out at Halloween.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yrRSI3kPS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vön Goth + Funk","source_asin":"B095SS9NXT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1031365","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095SS9NXT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095SS9NXT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
