window.products.push({"id":1031714,"name":"1st Birthday Girl Decorations Premium Party Supplies | Baby Princess First Pink Gold Girls Theme Kit | 1 Year Cake Topper, Happy Bday Banner Number Ba","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91-vgz8BFFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A magical combination of pink and gold for your baby girl's 1st birthday celebrations. 🎈 ALL-IN-ONE SUPER VALUE BUNDLE - 108 PIECES: Everything you can imagine for your princess in one bundle to fill your party area with a classic combination of bright, glittery and soft shades of Pink, Gold, Peach and White. Your guests, and most importantly your angel baby girl will absolutely love these decorations. That's our promise! 🌟BARGAIN PROMOTIONAL PRICE + HIGH QUALITY: No compromise on quality. You won't find rips or holes in our balloons (unlike most other bundles out there). The card paper banners are absolutely top class (and spelled correctly!!!), the double-sided glittery ONE Cake Topper and Triangle Bunting are all set to glamorize your memorable milestone pictures. Awesome for dogs, cats, bunny, deer, baby shark, mouse, pigs, kitty or any other pet animal's theme or with donut grown up, pumpkin, pinapple etc. 🌟 COLOR COMBINATIONS: If you've seen comments on other decoration sets, you'll know that not many put the effort in to optimize the color combinations like we have done. We've got complimenting mix of soft and bright pinks and peach, glittery and metallic golds, pearl whites and matte whites. Get raving compliments from your friends and family on your choice of decor. The set up will take your 1 year old into a magical onederland of rainbows, unicorns, flamingos, flowers and butterflies! 🌟 CONVENIENCE: We know you don't want to waste your precious party preparation time with tedious tasks like putting ribbons through all the banners. That's why we've pre-strung both our Banner ('HAPPY BIRTHDAY') and the Triangle Bunting for you + Superfast shipping via Fulfilment by Amazon. All you may now need is a tutu tulle highchair skirt, some invitation cards, cute party favors, gifts, tablecloth and plates, doughnut cake and some friends and family to celebrate with. ❤️ RETURNS POLICY - We're absolutely sure you'll love our product - but just for your complete peace of mind, we operate a hassle free 30-day returns/refund policy (from date of purchase). If there is ANY fault with the set let us know and we'll ship out another or give you a refund! Buy Now with Confidence ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91-vgz8BFFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FunDeco Party","source_asin":"B07TTYJKRH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1031714","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TTYJKRH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TTYJKRH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
