window.products.push({"id":1031721,"name":"Silicone Spoon Rest for Kitchen Counter - 4 Pack Large Utensil Rest Food Grade Plastic Spoon Holder for Stove Top,Ladle,Brush,Risotto,Cooking Spatula","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51zVlVgTt+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Premium Quality】: This functional spoon rest is made of high-quality food-grade silicone material to make it be your long-lasting cooking partner. The spoon rest for kitchen counter can resist up to 500° F, you can put your hot spoon right from the boiling broth on spoon rest. The flexible spoon holder will not break easily, no matter how many times it falls. 【Simple But Modern】: The modern look of this silicone spoon rest enhances the grace of your kitchen interior. Available in decent colors, this stove spoon holder is a simple but very classy item that helps you to keep your countertop clean of spoon stains, adding elegance to your kitchen counter decor. The plain look of the spoon rest for stove top integrates easily into any interior. 【Easy to Clean】: The smooth surfaced kitchen spoon holder is so easy to clean that you will find it a blessing to be in your kitchen. The dishwasher safe spoon carrier doesn't take much time of yours. Make sure to wash them every time after cooking, or the particles or stains from the cooking spoon might remain on then, causing contamination of the food you cook next time. 【Ideal Size】: The lightweight kitchen utensil holder is just the right size that can easily accommodate large, medium, or small spoons. You can use the silicone spoon holder for cooking spoons, spatulas, brushes, rice spoon, soup spoon, stirrer, wooden spoon, tongs, ladle, slotted spoon, risotto, or whatever you want. The perfect shape and design will keep your spoon balanced. 【Worry Free Aftersales Service】:100% money back if has quality problem or you are unsatisfied with our products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51zVlVgTt+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Skoxkoc","source_asin":"B09PT9XBWW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1031721","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PT9XBWW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PT9XBWW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
