window.products.push({"id":1031800,"name":"Umbra Cappa, ¾” Adjustable Curtain Rod for Windows – 72 to 144” Drapery Rod, Nickel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71D2aGX70YL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"With a modern yet understated design, the Cappa curtain rod is the perfect way to complement your curtains or drapes without drawing attention away from them. The clean, minimalistic styling and attractive matte finish is a decorator's dream because it works with a wide variety of decorative styles and color palettes. Best of all, it does so without breaking the bank. When it comes to curtain rods, quality construction counts and Cappa doesn't disappoint. Unlike cheaply made rods that tend to bend or warp over time, each Cappa curtain rod from Umbra is made of high-quality metal and individually checked for quality assurance. Sturdy and designed to support a variety of window fashions including light to medium weight curtains with a max weight of 22lbs. Finding and mounting the right sized curtain rod can sometimes be a challenge but that isn't the case with Cappa. Plus, everything you need to get it set up fast comes in the box including 2 metal finials, 3 wall-mounted curtain rod brackets, screws, drywall anchors and easy-to-follow installation instructions. Adding attractive window coverings to your bedroom, family room, living room, dining room, or kitchen is the quick and cost-effective way to instantly upgrade your home decor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71D2aGX70YL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Umbra","source_asin":"B08CFXLMSS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1031800","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CFXLMSS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CFXLMSS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
