window.products.push({"id":1031802,"name":"Evolur Cheyenne and Santa Fe Double Dresser, Antique Mist","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":582.8,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91yUWLv1VCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Blending form and function, the Evolur Santa Fe Double Dresser offers you a handsome yet practical piece of storage furniture for your home. Fitted with seven deep and spacious drawers, it provides ample space to organize all your belongings. It is perfect for your baby's nursery or your bedroom. It's generously sized drawers offer enough space to hold all of your baby's essentials or to store adult-size clothing. Inspired by the Southwest, the Santa Fe Double Dresser features a clean form, fine dentil molding details, and strong, handcrafted feet. Its gender-neutral and timeless styling makes it an excellent fit for a variety of decor themes. Make it part of your bedroom, living room, or even your entryway. It adds a certain sophistication to any space. Made out of kiln-dried hardwood and hardwood veneers, the Santa Fe Double Dresser is built to last. All the drawers feature five-piece independent drawer box construction with English Dovetail joint, heavy-duty side-mounted three full tier extension glides, and solid wood drawer pulls, which provide durability over the years. Take your pick from 3 classy finishes - the rustic Antique Brown, the sophisticated Storm Grey, and the chic Antique Mist.Safety is always our No.1 priority! All of our nursery furniture is tested for lead and other toxic elements to meet or exceed government and ASTM safety standards. The Santa Fe Double Dresser comes with an anti-tip kit that can be installed to prevent tip-overs. The Santa Fe Double Dresser measures 54 L(W) x 20.25 W(D) x 33.25 H inches. For your convenience, it comes completely assembled.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91yUWLv1VCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Evolur","source_asin":"B08B4R1CGL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1031802","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08B4R1CGL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08B4R1CGL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
