window.products.push({"id":1031817,"name":"CUSIMAX Bread Machine, Up To 2LB Loaf Capacity for Family, 15-in-1 Bread Maker for Gluten Free Bread, White Breadmaker Machines with Nonstick Pan, 3 C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HzHeoNzGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[15-in-1 Menu Settings] A fully-featured Bread Machine making fresh healthy bread an everyday treat. CUSIMAX Bread Maker offers 15 menu options to meet all your needs in Gluten Free Bread, Quick Bread, Basic Bread, Whole Wheat Bread, Jam, Cake and a wide variety of homemade bread to customize, it's up to you. That's where a bread machine comes into play. [Family Size Capacity] This breadmaker machines has options for 2 loaf sizes (750g/1LB, 1000g/2LB), 3 crust colors (Light/Medium/Dark), which is an ideal gift for family and friends. While baking, thanks to the non-stick material bread pan and a kneading paddle, it's easy to make the dough evenly and take out the whole loaf. After using, the bread pan is very easy to clean because of the removable design, for your convenient life. [Easier & More Fun] Designed with a bright LCD display for clearly to show your desired settings, including program menu, bread size, crust color and tell you what time your bread will be done. Plus, the breadmakers machine has a viewing window on top that you can easily look inside to see what is happening with your bread to satisfy your curiosity. Baking has never been easier and more fun! [Healthy & Freshly Bread] Do you want to enjoy the fresh and savory bread without getting up early? Our Gluten Free bread maker features 15-hour Delay Timer and 1-Hour Automatic Keep Warm function, just set the delay start time in advance, for your freshly-baked and warm bread at any time. It also comes with 10-minute power-off memory to continue the process automatically in the event of a power outage. Go in your healthy, freshly and tasty bread with CUSIMAX breadmaker! [What You Get] CUSIMAX durable bread maker machine comes with the accessories including 1 x Kneading Paddle, 1 x Metal Hook, 1 x Measuring Cup, 1 x Measuring Spoon, and an Instruction Manual, which help you prepare the bread ingredients accurately. And provide Free Lifetime Customer Service and support for 180-day worry-free return policy. If you need any help, please feel free to contact us via email.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HzHeoNzGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CUSIMAX","source_asin":"B096P1BR6X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1031817","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096P1BR6X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096P1BR6X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
