window.products.push({"id":1031833,"name":"MIDCLOCK Flip Clock, Home Décor Desk Clock, Retro Auto Flip Down Clock, Vintage Large Number Clock, Stainless Steel, Battery Powered, Digital Clocks f","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51u1BMej1-L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"This mechanical retro flip clock was originally designed by Dutch designer and American designer gives a new idea on it. We---MIDCLOCK manufacture it. Compared with other digital clocks, this kind of digital clock display time neither through the pointer, not through the LCD screen, but with a similar sports game scoreboard display to show. You can easy to read from distance and any angle.  This retro flip clock is an ideal gift for Birthday, Father day, Thanksgiving Day and Christmas. Perfect decorative for office, kitchen and living room etc. Specifications: 12 Hour AM/ PM Clock  Flip Down Minute and Hour Display  Gear Operated Time Adjustment  Power Source: 1 x D Battery (not included)  Dimensions: 8.2 x 3 x 6.2 inches (LxWxH)  How to use your flip clock?  STEP 1: Prepare 1x D Battery (Please use CARBON-ZINC battery, NOT the Alkaline battery);  STEP 2: Turn the battery cover in the direction of “OFF”, when the two triangles meet, take it off;  STEP 3: Install the battery. Please note the “+” towards outside;  STEP 4: Turn the battery cover in the direction of “ON”. When the Bar corresponds with triangle, battery has been installed;  STEP 5: Rotate the direction knob counter clockwise to adjust time (Please set 1 minute earlier than the exact time). Buy Yours Now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51u1BMej1-L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MIDCLOCK","source_asin":"B07RR2PF9Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1031833","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RR2PF9Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RR2PF9Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
