window.products.push({"id":1031846,"name":"Graduation Party Decorations Red for Class of 2023- 77pcs Red Black Grad 2023 Number Balloons Congrats Banner Fringe Foil and LED String Light for 202","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MLkiIJf9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔️ 2023 GRADUATION PARTY DECOR: Including a huge 2023 red and black foil number balloons, 60pcs 12\" latex balloons (20pcs for each black and red, 10pcs for each white and confetti balloon), 5pcs 10\" black red star foil balloons, 1pc black red Congrats banner, 1pc red curtain, and 6.56ft long LED string light, red satin ribbon, white satin ribbon, balloon strip tape, plastic needle, and dot glue. One pack contains everything you need for a stunning graduation party. ✔️ GLOWING BALLOONS ARCH: The LED string light powered by coin cell batteries will light up your grad party night! Once turned on, it will emit bright and soft red light that will go perfectly with the black and red graduation balloons, making the grad party decor shine even at night and creating a more atmospheric, and impressive party effect. ✔️ GREAT GRAD DECOR: With the perfect combination of jumbo 2023 number balloons, shiny red foil curtains, and thick Congrats banner, our class of 2023 party decor makes it easy to set up a gorgeous and eye-catching graduation backdrop, perfect for your graduation party centerpieces that will create unforgettable memories on this special day. ✔️ BLACK RED BALLOONS: These black and red graduation balloons are well made of 100% natural latex and high-quality foil material, with no holes, and odorless, heavy thick, and durable, work well with helium or air, not easy to break. Please don’t over-inflate to avoid bursting. ✔️ CONFETTI BALLOONS: Confetti balloons have black red confetti prefilled, what you have to do is blow them up and scrub the balloon on clothes, hair, or carpet to produce static so confetti could attach to the inner wall of the balloon beautifully. ✔️ 2023 GRAD PARTY: These graduation party supplies are suitable for the 2023 graduation party, class of 2023 party, 2023 college and senior high school graduation, nursing graduation, university event, and more. All will work out great, and your party display's final effect will be awesome. 😀 90 DAY AFTER-SALE SERVICE: At Better Now, our # 1 priority is to bring happiness to our guests! If you have any quality problems with our products, please contact us!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MLkiIJf9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GuassLee","source_asin":"B09TW1M783","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1031846","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TW1M783","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TW1M783","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
