window.products.push({"id":1031954,"name":"SUEWRITE Deep Fryer with Basket, 4.2 Qt Stainless Steel Electric Deep Fryer 1650W Oil Fryer Pot with Temperature Control Cool Touch Sides Silver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":54.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZTDp+Ns9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍔LARGE CAPACITY & HIGH PERFORMANCE: 4.2 quart/4 liter oil capacity deep fryer cooks up to 17 cups of favorite fried foods in the chrome-plated baskets. Also, our deep fryers Feature 1650 Watt immersible heating element, with quick heating and constant temperature monitoring, so you get consistently crispy, always delicious results. 🍟ADJUSTABLE TEMPERATURE CONTROL: Our deep fryers for the home with basket feature temperature control function and a heating indicator light; the temperature can be adjusted from 140℉ to 392℉ (60℃-200℃), and you can set the optimal temperature depending on what you’re cooking. Ideal for making onion rings, fried chicken wings, shrimp, French fries, fried chicken, and numerous other tasty foods. 🍗EASY TO ASSEMBLE, USE AND CLEAN: SUEWRITE small deep fryer is designed to be easy to assemble and use. When food is finished frying, hook the basket over the oil tank to easily remove excess oil from your food. The removable lid, fryer pot, basket, and housing are dishwasher safe. INDICATOR LIGHTS: separate power and ready indicator lights to let you know when oil is ready. 🥞SAFETY PROTECTION & HUMANIZED DESIGN: Our deep fat fryer Comes with a lid for the tank, which can prevent the splashing of boiled oil. 4 cool touch handles are anti-scalding and easy to hold. In addition, the anti-skid pad at the bottom increases stability. Deep fryer pot built-in overheating protection to provide more safety. 💎HIGH QUALITY & MULTI-PURPOSE: Deep fryer body is made of stainless steel with great corrosion and heat resistance for quick heating and frying. Let SUEWRITE frying machine work for your whole family, for parties, dinners, family gatherings, birthday parties, and kitchen. If you have any problems with our products, please let us know for support.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZTDp+Ns9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SUEWRITE","source_asin":"B0BQQB99FS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1031954","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQQB99FS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQQB99FS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
